---
const stages = [
  {
    stage: 'Vision',
    status: 'Decades old',
    known: 'Gateway has been part of Charlotte rail planning since the 1990s.',
    friction: 'The idea keeps expanding as the district vision grows around it.',
    next: 'Name the minimum useful station separately from the full district.'
  },
  {
    stage: 'Land',
    status: 'Split control',
    known: 'Public reporting points to City and NCDOT land interests around the site.',
    friction: 'Transfers and authority changes can add another handoff.',
    next: 'Publish who controls each parcel and what must move.'
  },
  {
    stage: 'Rail work',
    status: 'Mostly built',
    known: 'Track, structures, and signal work were completed in 2022.',
    friction: 'Trains can reach the site before riders can use it.',
    next: 'Protect passenger access as its own delivery milestone.'
  },
  {
    stage: 'Station',
    status: 'Unopened',
    known: 'Waiting, ticketing, platform access, and the passenger experience remain unresolved.',
    friction: 'Temporary station, permanent station, and full development are competing paths.',
    next: 'Choose the fastest credible opening path in public.'
  },
  {
    stage: 'District',
    status: 'Long game',
    known: 'The larger vision includes buses, streetcar, future rail, private development, and public space.',
    friction: 'Market conditions and scope can slow the basic station if they stay bundled.',
    next: 'Sequence the big vision after passengers can board downtown.'
  },
];
---

<figure
  class="gpm-figure"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Gateway Station process map showing five stages: vision, land, rail work, station, and district. Each stage names what is known, what friction may be slowing the work, and the next decision the public should be able to see."
>
  <div class="gpm-topline">
    <span class="gpm-kicker">Process map</span>
    <h3>Where Gateway Slows Down</h3>
    <p>The useful question: which handoff owns the next move?</p>
  </div>

  <div class="gpm-board" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="gpm-board-head">
      <span>Stage</span>
      <span>What we know</span>
      <span>Friction to test</span>
      <span>Next visible decision</span>
    </div>

    <ol class="gpm-rows" role="list">
      {stages.map((item, index) => (
        <li class="gpm-row" style={`--i:${index}`}>
          <div class="gpm-stage-cell">
            <span class="gpm-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <div>
              <strong>{item.stage}</strong>
              <span>{item.status}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>{item.known}</p>
          <p>{item.friction}</p>
          <p>{item.next}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="gpm-mobile-list">
    {stages.map((item, index) => (
      <section class="gpm-mobile-card" style={`--i:${index}`}>
        <span class="gpm-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
        <h4>{item.stage}</h4>
        <p><strong>Status:</strong> {item.status}</p>
        <p><strong>Friction:</strong> {item.friction}</p>
        <p><strong>Next:</strong> {item.next}</p>
      </section>
    ))}
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    This is the map I wish existed in public: what is done, what is unclear, and which decision moves passengers closer to an Uptown station.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gpm-figure {
    container-type: inline-size;
    position: relative;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 143, 211, 0.22);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 0.65rem + 2cqw, 2rem);
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 143, 211, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 28px 28px,
      linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0, 143, 211, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 28px 28px,
      radial-gradient(95% 70% at 8% 0%, rgba(52, 186, 255, 0.22), transparent 58%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #06171f 0%, #0a2130 48%, #132235 100%);
    color: #fbfaf6;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(6, 23, 31, 0.28);
  }

  .gpm-figure::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 0%, rgba(52, 186, 255, 0.1) 46%, transparent 58%);
    transform: translateX(-72%);
    animation: gpm-scan 7s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .gpm-topline {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    max-width: 58rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(1rem, 0.75rem + 1.2cqw, 1.6rem);
  }

  .gpm-kicker {
    color: #34baff;
    font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 0.6rem + 0.28cqw, 0.78rem);
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .gpm-topline h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 0.95rem + 1.5cqw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .gpm-topline p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #d7e8f3;
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 0.78rem + 0.35cqw, 1rem);
  }

  .gpm-board {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.16);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.06);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .gpm-board-head,
  .gpm-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(8rem, 0.85fr) repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .gpm-board-head {
    background: rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.1);
    color: #a5b8ee;
    font-size: clamp(0.62rem, 0.58rem + 0.2cqw, 0.74rem);
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .gpm-board-head span,
  .gpm-row > * {
    padding: clamp(0.65rem, 0.5rem + 0.7cqw, 0.95rem);
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.12);
  }

  .gpm-board-head span:last-child,
  .gpm-row > *:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .gpm-rows {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .gpm-row {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.12);
    animation: gpm-row-in 0.48s ease both;
    animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 0.08s);
  }

  .gpm-row:nth-child(3) {
    background: rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.1);
  }

  .gpm-row:nth-child(4) {
    background: rgba(52, 186, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .gpm-stage-cell {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.62rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .gpm-index {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 1.8rem;
    height: 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #06171f;
    background: #f4c430;
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .gpm-stage-cell strong {
    display: block;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 0.78rem + 0.35cqw, 1rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }

  .gpm-stage-cell span:not(.gpm-index) {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.18rem;
    color: #34baff;
    font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 0.62rem + 0.24cqw, 0.78rem);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .gpm-row p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #e9f3f8;
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 0.66rem + 0.24cqw, 0.85rem);
    line-height: 1.36;
  }

  .gpm-mobile-list {
    display: none;
  }

  .gpm-mobile-card {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.14);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 0.82rem;
    background: rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.07);
    animation: gpm-row-in 0.48s ease both;
    animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 0.08s);
  }

  .gpm-mobile-card h4 {
    margin: 0.38rem 0 0.42rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .gpm-mobile-card p {
    margin: 0.32rem 0 0;
    color: #e9f3f8;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.34;
  }

  .gpm-mobile-card strong {
    color: #a5b8ee;
  }

  .gpm-figure figcaption {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: clamp(0.85rem, 0.65rem + 0.8cqw, 1.2rem) 0 0;
    color: #e2f9d9;
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 0.7rem + 0.3cqw, 0.92rem);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  @keyframes gpm-scan {
    0%, 18% { transform: translateX(-72%); opacity: 0; }
    36%, 68% { opacity: 1; }
    82%, 100% { transform: translateX(72%); opacity: 0; }
  }

  @keyframes gpm-row-in {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @container (max-width: 760px) {
    .gpm-board {
      display: none;
    }

    .gpm-mobile-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }

  @container (max-width: 520px) {
    .gpm-mobile-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .gpm-figure::after,
    .gpm-row,
    .gpm-mobile-card {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>